<title>NEW ZEALAND: Telecom 3rd qtr result due on Feb 18.</title>
<headline>Telecom 3rd qtr result due on Feb 18.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-02-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Telecom Corp of New Zealand said on Monday it would release its results for the nine months to December 31 on February 18.</p>
<p>-- Wellington newsroom 64 4 4734 746</p>
